        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Lindstedt, Alex O'Brien, Radu Albot, Dušan Lajović, Jürgen Melzer\n- Events: 2015 Istanbul Open – Doubles\n- Roles: professional tennis players, doubles specialist\n- Places: Amarillo, Texas, United States, Sweden\n\nFacts:\n- Alex O'Brien was born on March 7, 1970, in Amarillo, Texas, and he is a retired professional tennis player from the United States who competed on the ATP Tour.\n- Robert Lindstedt was born on March 19, 1977, and he is a Swedish professional tennis player.\n- Robert Lindstedt turned professional in 1998 and became a doubles specialist.\n- At the 2015 Istanbul Open – Doubles, Radu Albot and Dušan Lajović won the title by defeating Robert Lindstedt and Jürgen Melzer in the final, 6–4, 7–6.",
